  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the aperture it is a black ladybug-like Gu, shaking its wings and hovering.",
        "chapters": [
          115
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Black Boar Gu belongs in the Boar Gu series with White Boar Gu, Flower Boar Gu, and Pink Boar Gu, priced at about six hundred primeval stones for Black or White. White and Black Boar Gu are equally well-known rare rank one Gu, worth more than the Liquor worm.",
        "chapters": [
          62
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_flower_boar_gu",
          "gu_liquor_worm"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s aperture after purchase it appears as a black ladybug-like Gu that can hover on wings.",
        "chapters": [
          115
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The first sale scene only shows the fake in a clansman’s hand as a black Gu worm, not a verified Black Boar Gu form.",
        "chapters": [
          44
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Like the White Boar Gu, it changes constitution and raises strength permanently. The gain accumulates, stays with the body even if the Gu dies,",
        "chapters": [
          62
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_white_boar_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "and does not need primeval essence to keep that strength available in a fight. After one person has used the Gu, it can still be given to another person to use.",
        "chapters": [
          96
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "White Boar Gu alone stops at one boar’s strength. A second White Boar Gu adds nothing after that limit. Black Boar Gu is different: its ability can overlay White Boar Gu’s.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later fights with the strength of two boars from holding both.",
        "chapters": [
          120
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He buys a Black Boar Gu from Jia Fu’s caravan treehouse after he already has White Boar strength, specifically because Black can stack where another White cannot.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He later trades that Gu to Gu Yue Qing Shu for a Fish Scale Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          123
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_qing_shu",
          "gu_fish_scale_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
