  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The name first appears when a Gu Yue clansman claims Jia Jin Sheng sold him a fake Black Boar Gu. Jia Jin Sheng calls a real Black Boar Gu a rare Gu that raises a Gu Master’s strength and is normally sold at about six hundred primeval stones.",
        "chapters": [
          44
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_yue_clan",
          "char_jia_jin_sheng",
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Jia Fu later adds that it raises strength permanently, that it is only rank one, and that the pricing is around six hundred.",
        "chapters": [
          45
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_jia_fu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later retells the same scam as Jia Jin Sheng selling a smelly fart fat worm as a Black Boar Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          56
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Rank one Black Boar Gu already has a named fusion line with Green Silk Gu into rank two Black Mane Gu, then rank three Steel Mane Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          47
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "advancement-line-named-early",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_green_silk_gu",
          "gu_black_mane_gu",
          "gu_steel_mane_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later judges that Steel Mane path of little use once he already has White Jade Gu, and prefers to trade the Black Boar Gu away.",
        "chapters": [
          123
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "advancement-line-named-early",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_white_jade_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the Shang clan city stretch, while Wei Yang argues against the strength path, Fang Yuan lists black and white boar Gu among the Gu he used to modify his body and raise strength. Wei Yang then calls those Gu expensive ones that permanently increase strength.",
        "chapters": [
          280
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "strength-path-body-modification",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "char_wei_yang",
          "path_strength"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Without Gu worms that modify the body like Black Boar Gu and White Boar Gu, a Gu Master’s body is no different from a mortal’s; dao marks from such modification are what make the body extraordinary.",
        "chapters": [
          1024
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "strength-path-body-modification",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In Reverse Flow River terms, using Black Boar Gu to gain a boar’s strength carves strength path dao marks into the body, so that strength still remains usable even when Gu worms cannot be activated.",
        "chapters": [
          1272
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "strength-path-body-modification",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_reverse_flow_river"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The smelly fart fat worm is a rank one poison path Gu that looks like Black Boar Gu and is often sold by unscrupulous merchants as a fake Black Boar Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2098
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fake-lookalikes",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
